Loan Application Chatbot
Project Overview

The Loan Application Chatbot is an AI-powered conversational bot designed to assist users in applying for loans quickly and efficiently. It interacts with users, collects required information, and provides guidance on loan applications. This project is built using Python and deployed on Render.

Features

Conversational interface for loan applications.

Collects user information like name, income, loan amount, etc.

Provides feedback on loan eligibility.

Can be integrated with databases or APIs for real loan processing.

AI-driven responses for natural interaction.

Technology Stack

Backend: Python

Frontend: HTML/CSS/JS (if any UI)

AI: Chatbot logic (Python or AI model)

Version Control: Git & GitHub

Deployment: Render

Environment Variables: Used for API keys, secrets, etc.
